1
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:20,399
I'm sorry, ma'am.

2
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:23,480
They forced me to do it.

3
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:28,480
Please, just let me see her.

4
00:00:29,480 --> 00:00:30,800
I want to apologize to her in person.

5
00:02:01,519 --> 00:02:02,280
I'm sorry.

6
00:02:16,879 --> 00:02:17,879
You misunderstood.

7
00:02:18,919 --> 00:02:19,759
Back then, I...

8
00:02:20,759 --> 00:02:21,400
I... Anyway,

9
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:22,639
it's not what you think.

10
00:02:22,680 --> 00:02:24,039
Why are you still making excuses?

11
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:26,360
Liu Yang,

12
00:02:26,960 --> 00:02:29,360
stop putting on your good guy persona.

13
00:02:29,680 --> 00:02:31,960
Deep down, you're no different from them.

14
00:02:32,240 --> 00:02:33,560
Except you're just

15
00:02:34,080 --> 00:02:35,520
a bit more despicable.

16
00:02:36,080 --> 00:02:37,240
You Psycho!

17
00:02:38,360 --> 00:02:39,800
Liu Yang! Liu Yang!

18
00:02:41,240 --> 00:02:42,759
To think I wanted to help you! Calm down!

19
00:02:42,759 --> 00:02:44,039
She still has your child!

20
00:02:44,639 --> 00:02:46,240
Bullshit! That's not my child!

21
00:02:46,240 --> 00:02:47,439
You're crazy!

22
00:02:48,199 --> 00:02:49,599
Stop fighting!

23
00:03:36,759 --> 00:03:37,719
Are you satisfied?

24
00:03:38,439 --> 00:03:39,319
Of course.

25
00:03:41,039 --> 00:03:42,240
It's a live broadcast.

26
00:03:43,319 --> 00:03:44,919
Xiaochen and Xiao Yu will finally get

27
00:03:44,919 --> 00:03:46,360
the full picture of their parents.

28
00:03:47,599 --> 00:03:48,360
Lin Yajing.

29
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:52,919
You can beat or curse at me all you want,

30
00:03:53,719 --> 00:03:55,599
but can you tell me where the kids are?

31
00:04:02,159 --> 00:04:03,319
You want to know?

32
00:04:07,199 --> 00:04:08,039
The address.

33
00:04:09,080 --> 00:04:09,639
Don't move.

34
00:04:12,159 --> 00:04:13,080
Stand up.

35
00:04:27,639 --> 00:04:28,800
Stop! Leave me alone!

36
00:04:29,199 --> 00:04:29,920
Come over here.

37
00:04:30,319 --> 00:04:31,040
Do you hear me?

38
00:04:31,439 --> 00:04:31,959
Leave me alone!

39
00:04:32,759 --> 00:04:33,279
I'm going to kill him!

40
00:04:45,040 --> 00:04:47,079
Hurry up and take your clothes off.

41
00:04:47,439 --> 00:04:48,720
Hurry up.

42
00:04:48,759 --> 00:04:49,879
We said we don't want you

43
00:04:49,879 --> 00:04:51,000
wearing the same uniform as us.

44
00:04:51,920 --> 00:04:53,720
Move it! What are you doing?

45
00:04:55,199 --> 00:04:56,000
Come on, hurry up.

46
00:04:57,920 --> 00:04:58,920
So slow.

47
00:05:00,439 --> 00:05:01,240
Don't touch me!

48
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:02,720
What?

49
00:05:05,439 --> 00:05:07,240
Don't touch me! Okay! Wait, wait, wait!

50
00:05:08,240 --> 00:05:08,920
You choose.

51
00:05:09,800 --> 00:05:11,879
Either I tell those three to turn around

52
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:12,839
and you take it off yourself,

53
00:05:13,759 --> 00:05:15,240
or the three of them come at you

54
00:05:15,639 --> 00:05:17,199
and take it off for you. Alright?

55
00:05:19,920 --> 00:05:20,759
What's your choice?

56
00:05:21,360 --> 00:05:22,120
I'll take it off myself.

57
00:05:24,560 --> 00:05:25,000
Okay.

58
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:26,079
Turn around. Turn, turn, turn.

59
00:05:26,439 --> 00:05:27,720
You, come here.

60
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:03,480
I'm begging you.

61
00:06:06,120 --> 00:06:07,920
I love that look on your face.

62
00:06:08,759 --> 00:06:10,120
It's so amusing.

63
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:33,120
Who would've thought?

64
00:06:35,560 --> 00:06:37,439
Such a perfectly good leg.

65
00:06:39,120 --> 00:06:40,120
Your leg...

66
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:42,399
You're not crippled now, are you?

67
00:06:43,120 --> 00:06:47,160
How did it end up crippled?

68
00:06:47,759 --> 00:06:48,560
Does it hurt?

69
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:49,560
What are you doing?

70
00:06:49,879 --> 00:06:50,879
Just showing I care. Don't move.

71
00:06:51,480 --> 00:06:52,199
Tell me, does it hurt?

72
00:06:58,920 --> 00:06:59,959
Gao Wenhao.

73
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:11,839
Xiao Hu, hurry to the address I gave you.

74
00:07:11,839 --> 00:07:13,439
Go pick up the kid. Hurry!

75
00:07:40,319 --> 00:07:41,480
Mr. Gao, we're here.

76
00:07:41,839 --> 00:07:42,839
We're here, we're here.

77
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:50,040
Mr. Gao, we found Xiaochen.

78
00:07:50,639 --> 00:07:51,759
She's with Xiao Yu.

79
00:07:52,319 --> 00:07:53,439
Yes, perfectly safe.

80
00:07:54,360 --> 00:07:56,720
Uncle Hu, what are you doing here?

81
00:08:40,919 --> 00:08:41,639
Okay, okay.

82
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:43,600
Slow down. Eat slowly, there's no rush.

83
00:08:43,600 --> 00:08:44,759
No one's fighting you for it.

84
00:08:45,279 --> 00:08:46,200
I'm sorry.

85
00:08:46,600 --> 00:08:47,879
I didn't do it on purpose.

86
00:08:48,799 --> 00:08:50,279
I didn't mean to.

87
00:08:50,919 --> 00:08:51,720
I'm sorry.

88
00:08:53,159 --> 00:08:54,559
You didn't do anything wrong.

89
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:56,519
No need to apologize.

90
00:08:59,480 --> 00:09:00,840
Then am I a good person?

91
00:09:03,600 --> 00:09:04,320
You are.

92
00:09:06,879 --> 00:09:07,799
That's good.

93
00:09:10,320 --> 00:09:11,720
Good things happen to good people.

94
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:22,080
By the way, who are you?

95
00:09:25,080 --> 00:09:26,200
I'm your daughter.

96
00:09:26,840 --> 00:09:27,960
You're my daughter.

97
00:09:31,120 --> 00:09:32,360
Then I'm your mom.

98
00:09:35,759 --> 00:09:37,120
Am I a good mom?

99
00:09:42,320 --> 00:09:43,360
If I do something wrong,

100
00:09:43,399 --> 00:09:44,559
you can just scold me.

101
00:09:45,399 --> 00:09:46,200
Once I correct it,

102
00:09:46,200 --> 00:09:47,559
I'll be a good mom.

103
00:09:49,559 --> 00:09:51,360
I want to be a good mom.

104
00:09:52,039 --> 00:09:55,679
I want to be a mom who loves to smile.

105
00:09:55,840 --> 00:10:02,000
A good "Mom is the Best in the World" mom.

106
00:10:12,039 --> 00:10:13,799
How have you been the last few days?

107
00:10:48,120 --> 00:10:48,919
Pretty good.

108
00:10:54,399 --> 00:10:55,399
Are you happy?

109
00:11:57,399 --> 00:11:58,279
Teacher.

110
00:11:58,279 --> 00:12:01,679
They say summer camp turns us into adults.

111
00:12:01,679 --> 00:12:02,879
Is that true?

112
00:12:07,679 --> 00:12:09,200
Have you ever been to one?

113
00:12:12,279 --> 00:12:13,200
I have.

114
00:12:14,279 --> 00:12:15,039
It's just that...

115
00:12:15,919 --> 00:12:17,799
it might be a bit different from yours.

116
00:12:18,039 --> 00:12:19,200
When I grow up,

117
00:12:19,399 --> 00:12:21,879
I want to be someone like Teacher Yang.

118
00:12:24,519 --> 00:12:25,679
Someone like me?

119
00:12:27,399 --> 00:12:28,320
I want to be...

120
00:12:28,559 --> 00:12:32,039
someone gentle and kind like Teacher Yang.

121
00:12:34,399 --> 00:12:36,080
Did you bring your Switch?

122
00:12:36,519 --> 00:12:37,159
I did.

123
00:12:37,879 --> 00:12:39,200
Let's play a racing game.

124
00:12:39,200 --> 00:12:40,000
Sure.
